---
title: AdviseCare - Sequence Diagram SD-28 - Advance Case Stage
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor ADV as Advisor
    participant W as Web App
    participant C as CasesController
    participant S as CaseService
    participant N as INotificationService
    participant R as IGenericRepository
    participant DB as SQL Server
    ADV->>W: Move case to "closed" with a reason
    W->>C: PUT /api/Cases/{id}/stage {toStage, reason}
    C->>S: ChangeStageAsync(AdvisorId, CaseId, request)
    S->>R: Case visible to the caller and the caller is its advisor
    alt case closed, same stage, or a referral of the case is pending
        S-->>C: ConflictException / ValidationException
        C-->>W: 409 / 400
    else
        S->>R: PrepareCreate CaseStageHistory (from -> to, reason)
        opt toStage = closed
            S->>S: status = closed, closedAt = now
        end
        S->>R: PrepareUpdate Case, SaveAsync()
        R->>DB: UPDATE CASES, INSERT CASESTAGEHISTORIES
        S->>S: Log activity caseClosed / caseStageChanged
        opt closed
            S->>N: NotifyAsync(student, "Your case has been closed")
        end
        S-->>C: ChangeCaseStageResponse
        C-->>W: 200 OK
    end
    Note over W,DB: PUT /api/Cases/{id}/reopen sets status = reopened, stage closed -> assigned, clears closedAt and notifies the student
